# Wickerfolk Thresher, "Delirium — Whenever this creature attacks, if there are four or more card types among cards in your graveyard, look at the
# top card of your library. If it's a land card, you may put it onto the battlefield. If you don't put the card onto the battlefield, put it into your
# hand." Turn 1: Faithless Looting (sorcery) draws the Thresher and a Forest and discards Ornithopter (artifact, creature) and Lightning Bolt (instant):
